IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `tga-vaping`

-- Therapeutic Goods Act 1989 (Cth), Chapter 4A (ss 41P, 41Q-41QD) -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_therapeutic-goods-act-1989_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Life facts are from the workbench scenario au/wa/cradle-to-grave-jake/facts.json (Jake born 30 August 2006; k031 on
-- 2 June 2023, aged 16). The fixture ASSUMES one disposable nicotine vape, sold by a shop that is not a pharmacy.
-- The commercial quantity (60) and permitted quantity (9) are HYPOTHETICAL placeholders, not the regulations' figures,
-- which are not deposited.

