§ `s 41P -- are these vaping goods`

#ASSERT `Are these vaping goods` `a vaping substance (nicotine in solution, or any liquid for a vaping device)`
#ASSERT NOT `Are these vaping goods` `a humidifier, diffuser, nebuliser or inhaler`
#ASSERT NOT `Are these vaping goods` `goods the Minister has determined are not vaping goods`

§ `ss 41QC, 41QD -- is my possession an offence (k031)`

#ASSERT `Which quantity band am I in` `Jake's vape, had it been 2 June 2025` EQUALS `less than the commercial quantity`
#ASSERT `Which quantity band am I in` `150 times the commercial quantity` EQUALS `at least 100 times but less than 1,000 times the commercial quantity`

-- k031: on 2 June 2023 Chapter 4A was not yet in force (it began 1 July 2024), so this Act's vaping offences did not
-- reach Jake that day. On the same facts after 1 July 2024 his possession is still no offence: one vape is below the
-- commercial quantity and he is not a retailer. His age (16 or 30) changes nothing.
#ASSERT `Is my possession of vaping goods an offence` `Jake's vape, 2 June 2023` EQUALS `outside Chapter 4A: it was not yet in force (it began on 1 July 2024)`
#ASSERT `Is my possession of vaping goods an offence` `Jake's vape, had it been 2 June 2025` EQUALS `no offence: less than the commercial quantity and I am not a retailer at retail premises`
#ASSERT `Is my possession of vaping goods an offence` `the same vape held at 30` EQUALS `no offence: less than the commercial quantity and I am not a retailer at retail premises`
#ASSERT `Is my possession of vaping goods an offence` `a shop's stock under the commercial quantity` EQUALS `an offence under s 41QD: a retailer, less than the commercial quantity, at retail premises`
#ASSERT `Is my possession of vaping goods an offence` `a pharmacy's stock of registered goods` EQUALS `no offence: an exception applies`
#ASSERT `Is my possession of vaping goods an offence` `a shop worker's own vape at work` EQUALS `no offence: an exception applies`
#ASSERT `Is my possession of vaping goods an offence` `a shop worker's own stash above the permitted quantity` EQUALS `an offence under s 41QD: a retailer, less than the commercial quantity, at retail premises`
#ASSERT `Is my possession of vaping goods an offence` `twice the commercial quantity, lawfully supplied, for personal use` EQUALS `no offence: an exception applies`
#ASSERT `Is my possession of vaping goods an offence` `twice the commercial quantity, not lawfully supplied` EQUALS `an offence under s 41QC: at least the commercial quantity`
#ASSERT `Is my possession of vaping goods an offence` `a licensed importer's registered stock at 150 times` EQUALS `no offence: an exception applies`

#ASSERT NOT `Is my possession a retail-premises offence` `Jake's vape, had it been 2 June 2025`

-- s 41QC(11A)(c): the personal-use exception stops below 5 times the commercial quantity.
#ASSERT NOT `Is my possession a commercial-quantity offence` `twice the commercial quantity, lawfully supplied, for personal use`
#ASSERT `Is my possession a commercial-quantity offence` `six times the commercial quantity, lawfully supplied, for personal use`

§ `ss 41QC, 41QD -- what I could face for possession`

#ASSERT `What is the longest prison term in months for my possession` `a shop's stock under the commercial quantity` EQUALS 12
#ASSERT `What is the longest prison term in months for my possession` `twice the commercial quantity, not lawfully supplied` EQUALS 24
#ASSERT `What is the longest prison term in months for my possession` `1,000 times the commercial quantity` EQUALS 84
#ASSERT `What is the longest prison term in months for my possession` `Jake's vape, had it been 2 June 2025` EQUALS 0

#ASSERT `What is the largest fine in penalty units for my possession` `1,000 times the commercial quantity` EQUALS 5000

#ASSERT `What is the largest strict liability fine in penalty units for my possession` `a shop's stock under the commercial quantity` EQUALS 60

#ASSERT `What is the most civil penalty per unit for my possession` `a shop's stock under the commercial quantity` EQUALS 1000
#ASSERT `What is the most civil penalty per unit for my possession` `twice the commercial quantity, not lawfully supplied` EQUALS 7000

§ `s 41QB -- the sale to me (k031)`

-- k031: the scenario says the shop offended. Under this Act it did not on 2 June 2023 (Chapter 4A not yet in force);
-- the same sale after 1 July 2024 is an s 41QB offence. Any 2023 offence was under other law (not encoded here).
#ASSERT NOT `Was the supply to me an offence` `the shop's sale to Jake, 2 June 2023`
#ASSERT `Was the supply to me an offence` `the same sale, had it been 2 June 2025`
#ASSERT NOT `Was the supply to me an offence` `a pharmacist's supply for smoking cessation`
#ASSERT `Was the supply to me an offence` `a pharmacist's supply for any other use`
#ASSERT `Was the supply to me an offence` `a pharmacist's supply of a liquid not in final dosage form`
#ASSERT `Was the supply to me an offence` `a pharmacist's supply of goods with no standing`

#ASSERT `Was the supply to me within the retail exception` `a pharmacist's supply for smoking cessation`

-- What may lawfully be supplied to me: the Act names no age; the State law's answer is an input.
#ASSERT `May a pharmacist lawfully supply me vaping goods` `entered on the Register` `smoking cessation` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `May a pharmacist lawfully supply me vaping goods` `entered on the Register` `any other use` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `May a pharmacist lawfully supply me vaping goods` `entered on the Register` `managing nicotine dependence` TRUE FALSE

#ASSERT `What is the largest fine in penalty units for the seller` EQUALS 5000
#ASSERT `What is the longest prison term in years for the seller` EQUALS 7
#ASSERT `What is the most civil penalty per unit for the seller` TRUE EQUALS 70000

§ `ss 41Q, 41QA -- importing or making them myself`

#ASSERT `Would importing vaping goods myself be an offence` `a vaping device (an electronic heated aerosol device for inhalation)` (Date 2 6 2025) TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Would importing vaping goods myself be an offence` `a vaping device (an electronic heated aerosol device for inhalation)` (Date 2 6 2025) FALSE

#ASSERT `Would making vaping goods myself be an offence` `a vaping substance (nicotine in solution, or any liquid for a vaping device)` (Date 2 6 2025) FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Would making vaping goods myself be an offence` `a vaping substance (nicotine in solution, or any liquid for a vaping device)` (Date 2 6 2025) TRUE TRUE

